			"notes": "* Added in-game commands for configuring Vanishing Ground.\n* Added commands to enable and disable the mod.\n* Added a status command for checking the current configuration.\n* Added commands for changing the removal delay.\n* Added commands for allowing or protecting fluids.\n* Added commands for allowing or protecting blocks with block entities.\n* Configuration changes made through commands are saved automatically.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Zurret/vanishing-ground/commits/1.0.1"
